// VNEW_text_narrowed.schema — NEW: text string(4), the capacity narrowed
//
// One of the fixed form's UNLAWFUL lineage rows (docs/FIXED-FORM-VERSIONING-TESTS.md,
// internal/fixedunlawful). The OLD and the NEW file of this pair differ by
// EXACTLY string(8) -> string(4). `lead` and `trail` bracket the row's field.
//
// THIS PAIR IS DELIBERATELY UNLAWFUL: SPEC §5.1 refuses a narrowed capacity ("capacity narrowed"). The file's text
// is "ab", which fits this reader, so a leg that checks only the used length
// LOADS it.
// So this NEW side is generated and never dumped. The NEW reader must refuse old_text_narrowed.bin
// `layout_malformed` and write nothing (docs/FIXED-FORM-ALGORITHM.md §5.2, §5.4,
// §5.9 #30). Do not "fix" it.

package vnew_text_narrowed

fixed table TextNarrowed
{
    lead  uint32 = 1
    text  string(4)
    trail uint32 = 2
}
